## Mirror infrastructure used

For transparency and to aid future researchers troubleshooting similar
ingest pipelines from non-US IPs, the following mirror infrastructure proved
accessible from a Turkish IP without proxy:

- `gov.uk` (UK MOD via DCDC) — JDP series + UK MOD's mirrored NATO AJPs
- `armypubs.army.mil` — US Army ADP/ATP direct PDFs
- `web.archive.org` (Internet Archive — Wayback Machine) — verified snapshots of JCS, AF, OSD, and ICAO PDFs
- `publications.sto.nato.int` — NATO Science and Technology Organization public publications
- `easa.europa.eu` — EU regulator direct downloads
- `faa.gov/documentLibrary` — FAA direct stable PDFs (the dynamic `index.cfm` redirect endpoint returns HTML wrappers and is unsuitable for scripted ingest)
- `icao.int` (via Wayback) — ICAO public-release PDFs
- `crows.org` (Association of Old Crows, EW industry nonprofit) — JP 3-85 mirror
- `justsecurity.org` (NYU Law academic journal) — JP 3-60 2013 edition mirror
- `usna.edu` (US Naval Academy training reference) — JP 3-13.1 mirror
- `info.publicintelligence.net` — `MTTP-AirspaceControl.pdf` mirror (Distribution A content)
- `safety.marines.mil` (via Wayback) — JP 3-0 2017 edition mirror

